{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":2076,\"title\":\"Swindle\",\"tagline\":\"Friday 5.01PM... Bank Robbery In Progress... Nothing Is What It Seems.\",\"overview\":\"Four thieves attempt to make the richest score in history.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h5LSYgE5y4firthL82t1s84nny9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/49hriJp9Oop5Gu3pxeKzy3v2hgi.jpg\",\"rating\":4.6,\"voteCount\":19,\"year\":2002,\"runtime\":96,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"K.C. Bascombe\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":21285,\"name\":\"K.C. Bascombe\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3197,\"name\":\"Tom Sizemore\",\"character\":\"Seith Georg\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/soINOuacuiThRb2LyPD4tTWve7C.jpg\"},{\"id\":6681,\"name\":\"Sherilyn Fenn\",\"character\":\"Sophie Zieten\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dccP3pHxQ66Dg7swNlYRwxIJwyE.jpg\"},{\"id\":21290,\"name\":\"Dave Foley\",\"character\":\"Michael Barnes\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/muHRRGDTE7ZWk3guqDAk9L4DqVX.jpg\"},{\"id\":21291,\"name\":\"Conrad Pla\",\"character\":\"Cisco\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p09lsBpONGWdapNgbOvjsQokgXU.jpg\"},{\"id\":21292,\"name\":\"Alain Goulem\",\"character\":\"Curtis Locke\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q4mcnNmWyVnWNOH6VuWh7zRpFkt.jpg\"},{\"id\":21293,\"name\":\"Alan Fawcett\",\"character\":\"Lt. Dan Archer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xWfbQTpiOqgrY5dJ52Sx4WO4A66.jpg\"},{\"id\":115856,\"name\":\"Kenneth McGregor\",\"character\":\"Lukas\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aHzrpQScxIe6YTPskv2kii1AVEC.jpg\"},{\"id\":21294,\"name\":\"Katie Griffin\",\"character\":\"Judy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jply9h89yWO1y1ertpjZEuILkj4.jpg\"},{\"id\":109066,\"name\":\"Danny Wells\",\"character\":\"Lt. Jackson Craig\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8mdPZSdN8tmTzKmj1dGMFQs33RP.jpg\"},{\"id\":21296,\"name\":\"Genevieve Sabourin\",\"character\":\"Samantha Erickson\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":21297,\"name\":\"Vanya Rose\",\"character\":\"Cory Lee\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1789027,\"name\":\"Ryan Kennedy\",\"character\":\"Officer Richie O'Malley\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/UJ7bjL1bbgZkf3MqXjw5kdiL6R.jpg\"},{\"id\":1756358,\"name\":\"Lori Graham\",\"character\":\"Reporter\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3810737,\"name\":\"Sasha Gervais\",\"character\":\"Marc\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3602419,\"name\":\"Candace Sibley\",\"character\":\"Hooker\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1419406,\"title\":\"The Shadow's Edge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cHKo3m8N1fwvEy2ZEr0xGmmMODV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BtL2vvEufDXDP4u6xQjjQ1Y2aT.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Macau Police brings the tracking expert police officer out of retirement to help catch a dangerous group of professional thieves.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1236045,\"title\":\"Animals\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iISM36voS1E8gX9BM0DVK0kgi3E.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5yzM78Tp8nYwSCQtyRcmnHmCn5C.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the son of an L.A. mayoral candidate is kidnapped, he and his wife have a few hours to come up with the ransom payment. With most of their money spent on his political campaign, they have to get their hands dirty and expose a side of their lives they never intended to see the light of day.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":7451,\"title\":\"xXx\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xeEw3eLeSFmJgXZzmF2Efww0q3s.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qwK9soQmmJ7kRdjLZVXblw3g7AQ.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Xander Cage is your standard adrenaline junkie with no fear and a lousy attitude. When the US Government \\\"recruits\\\" him to go on a mission, he's not exactly thrilled. His mission: to gather information on an organization that may just be planning the destruction of the world, led by the nihilistic Yorgi.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":75780,\"title\":\"Jack Reacher\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uQBbjrLVsUibWxNDGA4Czzo8lwz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iwvP8XVpYVmJ3xfF9xdBi5uAOWl.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"One morning in an ordinary town, five people are shot dead in a seemingly random attack. All evidence points to a single suspect: an ex-military sniper who is quickly brought into custody. The interrogation yields one written note: 'Get Jack Reacher!'. Reacher, an enigmatic ex-Army investigator, believes the authorities have the right man but agrees to help the sniper's defense attorney. However, the more Reacher delves into the case, the less clear-cut it appears. So begins an extraordinary chase for the truth, pitting Jack Reacher against an unexpected enemy, with a skill for violence and a secret to keep.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":668489,\"title\":\"Havoc\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r46leE6PSzLR3pnVzaxx5Q30yUF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7rKyFSg6SdLoCRCVoWLjL5k658k.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a drug heist swerves lethally out of control, a jaded cop fights his way through a corrupt city's criminal underworld to save a politician's son.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":348893,\"title\":\"Boyka: Undisputed IV\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7QGdIJWWTkPhVjpQ0zA6z69khod.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tCsYQTkQx7vknDmTw666K1XxAdx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the fourth installment of the fighting franchise, Boyka is shooting for the big leagues when an accidental death in the ring makes him question everything he stands for. When he finds out the wife of the man he accidentally killed is in trouble, Boyka offers to fight in a series of impossible battles to free her from a life of servitude.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":646097,\"title\":\"Rebel Ridge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xEt2GSz9z5rSVpIHMiGdtf0czyf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cyKH7pDFlxIXluqRyNoHHEpxSDX.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A former Marine confronts corruption in a small town when local law enforcement unjustly seizes the bag of cash he needs to post his cousin's bail.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":136797,\"title\":\"Need for Speed\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4ktdbrhCnAoDGLW36afjB717Sa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/syVAWAnY6fTBDDFntHsM8vFjKex.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The film revolves around a local street-racer who partners with a rich and arrogant business associate, only to find himself framed by his colleague and sent to prison. After he gets out, he joins a New York-to-Los Angeles race to get revenge. But when the ex-partner learns of the scheme, he puts a massive bounty on the racer's head, forcing him to run a cross-country gauntlet of illegal racers in all manner of supercharged vehicles.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1128650,\"title\":\"The Prosecutor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n3ZnFqp988MWfIkT8OHofEJfjlt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4frrYwamVG0eXhdMTy3cpNNcCBp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A poor young man is wrongly charged with drug trafficking after being deceived. An ex-prosecutor investigates the case, uncovers a corrupt lawyer team's scheme, and restores justice despite obstruction from evil forces.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":941109,\"title\":\"Play Dirty\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ovZ0zq0NwRghtWI1oLaM0lWuoEw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k6tdiMTO39RQj3dhfspuzprfoe0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Expert thief Parker gets a shot at a major heist, but to pull it off he and his team must outsmart a South American dictator, the New York mob, and the world's richest man.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11636,\"title\":\"New Police Story\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kWUTyIao0b8DxVrO6L0LnpJVYWV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qDcLJIeg2z1oMtAWs9qFLeJVJ6E.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sent into a drunken tailspin when his entire unit is killed by a gang of thrill-seeking punks, disgraced Hong Kong police inspector Wing needs help from his new rookie partner, with a troubled past of his own, to climb out of the bottle and track down the gang and its ruthless leader.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":38234,\"title\":\"Undisputed III: Redemption\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g8KB77SPA7SyU8eid6TAEpt9skU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fTZlSRATSk7QJyUrpbmjScDtY8Z.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Russian inmate Boyka, now severely hobbled by the knee injury suffered at the end of Undisputed 2. No longer the feared prison fighter he was, he has declined so far that he is now good only for cleaning toilets. But when a new prison fight tournament begins - an international affair, matching the best fighters from prisons around the globe, enticing them with the promise of freedom for the winner - Boyka must reclaim his dignity and fight for his position in the tournament.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"SXDf3wsvRPM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"z42gccus-u4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"W3AwWxKZBX4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}